@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
title 账户充值时序图（含审批流程）

' 所有 SQL 操作使用 PreparedStatement 参数绑定，禁止字符串拼接
actor 用户 as U
actor 管理员 as Admin
participant "Flutter 客户端" as FE
participant "支付控制器" as Ctrl
participant "安全过滤器链" as Security
participant "支付服务" as PS
participant "用户服务" as US
participant "Mock 支付网关" as Gateway
database 数据库 as DB

U -> FE: 选择充值金额，选择支付方式\n点击"充值"
FE -> Ctrl: HTTP POST /api/v1/payments/recharge\n{amount: 100.00, method: "wechat", idempotencyKey: "<UUID>"}

group 授权检查 [Spring Security Filter Chain]
  Ctrl -> Security: JwtAuthenticationFilter 解析 Token\n提取 principal (userId, role)
  Security -> Security: @PreAuthorize("isAuthenticated()")
end

group 幂等性检查 [防止重复充值]
  Ctrl -> PS: recharge(userId, amount, method, idempotencyKey)
  PS -> DB: SELECT id FROM payments WHERE gateway_tx_id = ?
  DB --> PS: 查询结果

  alt idempotencyKey 已存在
    PS --> Ctrl: 返回已有支付记录 {paymentId}
    Ctrl --> FE: HTTP 200 {paymentId, redirectUrl, status: "existing"}
    FE --> U: 显示"该充值请求已提交"
  else idempotencyKey 不存在
    PS -> DB: INSERT INTO payments (id, user_id, method,\namount, status, gateway_tx_id)\nVALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, 'pending', ?)
    DB --> PS: 支付记录创建成功 (status: pending)
  end
end

PS --> Ctrl: 支付单已创建 {paymentId, status: "pending"}
Ctrl --> FE: HTTP 200 {paymentId, status: "PENDING"}
FE --> U: 显示"充值申请已提交，等待管理员审批..."

== 管理员审批环节 ==
note right Admin : 管理员登录后台查看待审核列表
Admin -> FE: 进入「充值审核」页面
FE -> Ctrl: GET /api/v1/payments/pending (ADMIN/SUPER_ADMIN)
Ctrl --> FE: 待审核充值列表
FE --> Admin: 显示待审批充值单（用户/金额/时间）

Admin -> FE: 点击「批准」
FE -> Ctrl: PUT /api/v1/payments/{id}/approve\n(ADMIN/SUPER_ADMIN)

Ctrl -> PS: approvePayment(paymentId, adminId)
PS -> DB: UPDATE payments SET status = 'approved'\nWHERE id = ? AND status = 'pending'
note right DB : 乐观锁：只有 status='pending' 才能审批\n防止并发重复审批
DB --> PS: 更新成功

group 系统模拟回调处理 [atomic]
  PS -> PS: 校验 HMAC 签名 (内部模拟)

  alt 签名验证通过
    PS -> DB: UPDATE payments SET status = 'success'\nWHERE id = ?
    DB --> PS: 支付状态更新成功

    PS -> DB: UPDATE users SET balance = balance + ?\nWHERE id = ?
    DB --> PS: 余额更新成功

    group 欠费自动补扣
      PS -> DB: SELECT cr.id, cr.fee FROM charge_records cr\nWHERE cr.user_id = ? AND cr.deduction_status = 'arrears'\nFOR UPDATE
      DB --> PS: 欠费记录列表

      alt 存在欠费记录
        loop 逐条处理欠费
          PS -> DB: UPDATE charge_records SET deduction_status = 'paid'\nWHERE id = ? AND deduction_status = 'arrears'
          PS -> DB: UPDATE users SET balance = balance - ?\nWHERE id = ? AND balance >= ?
          PS -> DB: UPDATE users SET frozen_until = NULL\nWHERE id = ? AND frozen_until IS NOT NULL
          DB --> PS: 补扣完成
        end
      end
    end

    PS -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs\n(actor_type, action, resource, resource_id)\nVALUES ('system', 'recharge', 'payment', ?)
    DB --> PS: 审计日志
  else 签名验证失败
    PS -> DB: UPDATE payments SET status = 'failed'\nWHERE id = ?
    DB --> PS: 标记失败
  end
end

PS --> Ctrl: 审批处理完成
Ctrl --> FE: HTTP 200 {status: "approved", message: "充值已批准，余额已更新"}
FE --> Admin: 显示"审批成功，余额已增加"

== 前端刷新余额 ==
U -> FE: 查看最新余额
FE -> Ctrl: GET /api/v1/users/balance
Ctrl -> US: getBalance(userId)
US -> DB: SELECT balance FROM users WHERE id = ?
DB --> US: 当前余额
US --> Ctrl: balance: 100.00
Ctrl --> FE: HTTP 200 {balance: 100.00}
FE --> U: 显示"充值成功，当前余额 100.00 元"
@enduml